# --- Data -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw feeds: rebuilt by `src/descargar.py` from the EPSS, KEV and NVD sources.
# Together they are ~18 MB and add nothing that the pipeline cannot regenerate.
data/epss.csv
data/nvd_cvss.csv

# Derived analysis table (~19 MB): rebuilt by `src/unir.py` from the three feeds.
# A reproducible 5,000-row sample with a fixed seed is versioned instead, so the
# schema and derived columns can be inspected without running the pipeline.
# See `src/generar_muestra.py`.
data/vulnerabilidades.csv

# Kept on purpose: the CISA KEV catalog (~96 KB) and the seeded sample are small
# and let anyone read the model without downloading anything.
!data/kev.csv
!data/muestra_vulnerabilidades.csv

